    /// Changes a circuit's rated current.
    ///
    /// The new rating may exceed the parent's, and may be below the sum of the
    /// circuit's children — an over-subscribed tree is a normal way to build a
    /// location, and every grant is still capped by the tightest ancestor.
    /// Requires the caller to be an Owner or Admin.
