    /// A location's supply per line
    ///
    /// Every circuit on the location with its rating per line and its current on
    /// L1, L2 and L3 summed over its subtree, and every charger's line, what
    /// it draws, what the scheduler allocated it, and whether a car is
    /// charging. Per line rather than in total, because a three-phase circuit
    /// can be full on one line while its total says there is room. Requires
    /// the caller to be a member of the organization that owns the location.
