    /// Revokes a grant — FR-008/FR-009/SC-002.
    ///
    /// Either side may end it: the customer organization always, and the
    /// installer organization for its own outstanding grant. There is no
    /// separate acceptance step to undo and no cache anywhere to invalidate —
    /// `authorization.RequireCustomerGrant` reads `status` live, so this write
    /// alone is what makes the installer's very next request refuse.
    ///
