    /// Binds a policy to a principal at a project.
    ///
    /// A policy that decides who may start a charge (`Charging`) is granted with
    /// `authorization.access_policy.manage`; a management policy with
    /// `identity.binding.manage`; a policy of both with both. Identity enforces the
    /// safety rules again: nobody grants a management permission they do not hold,
    /// the Owner binding moves only by transfer-ownership, and a person who
    /// charges is bound only in their own project and mode.
